OL,3,GNEWSAYouth charged after high school
OL,4,A'bomb threat' posted online
OL,5,
OL,6,FA male youth has been charged in
OL,7,Fconnection with malicious
OL,8,Fcommunications after a hoax school bomb
OL,9,Fthreat in East Kilbride.
OL,11,FPolice Scotland were alerted to the
OL,12,Fmessage, posted by an anonymous social
OL,13,Fmedia account, on Monday.
OL,15,FThe force said "subsequent online
OL,16,Fmessaging" claimed explosives had been
OL,17,Fhidden at Calderglen High School.
OL,19,FDuncanrig High School, which is less
OL,20,Fthan three miles away, was also
OL,21,Fmentioned as a possible target.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
